                <pb facs="0521" n="441" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg441"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stourdza,
                        president of the Council of Roumania, to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is not without keen emotion that the Royal Government of Roumania has received
                    the news of the tragic death of President McKinley. Please receive the most
                    sincere condolences of the president of the Council.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. Stourdza</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
